<title>ITALY: Italy's Scalfaro to visit Germany April 20-23.</title>
<headline>Italy's Scalfaro to visit Germany April 20-23.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian President Oscar Luigi Scalfaro will make a state visit to Germany from April 20 to 23 at the invitation of President Roman Herzog, the Italian presidential office said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It gave no details of Scalfaro's itinerary.</p>
